ndex.tsx:242:19">Social Media Specialist</h3><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-muted-foreground" data-tsd-source="/src/routes/index.tsx:243:19">Real Estate · Content Creator</p><p class="mt-3 text-sm text-pretty text-muted-foreground" data-tsd-source="/src/routes/index.tsx:244:19">Running the full content engine for a real estate brand — creative concepts, scripts, reels and daily Stories across Instagram, Facebook and TikTok, in sync with the sales and management teams.</p></div></div><div class="reveal " style="transition-delay:100ms" data-tsd-source="/src/components/Reveal.tsx:38:5"><div class="group relative h-full rounded-2xl border border-border bg-panel p-6 backdrop-blur-xl transition-colors hover:border-accent/40" data-tsd-source="/src/routes/index.tsx:221:17"><span class="absolute -top-1.5 left-6 size-3 rounded-full bg-accent shadow-[0_0_14px_var(--accent)]" data-tsd-source="/src/routes/index.tsx:228:19"></span><div class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-accent" data-tsd-source="/src/routes/index.tsx:235:19">May — Jul 2025</div><h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-2xl" data-tsd-source="/src/routes/index.tsx:242:19">Reel Maker</h3><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-muted-foreground" data-tsd-source="/src/routes/index.tsx:243:19">Bold Routes · Internship</p><p class="mt-3 text-sm text-pretty text-muted-foreground" data-tsd-source="/src/routes/index.tsx:244:19">Cut short-form video end to end: hooks, edits and captions for real-estate promotional, entertainment and educational content.</p></div></div><div class="reveal " style="transition-delay:200ms" data-tsd-source="/src/components/Reveal.tsx:38:5"><div class="group relative h-full rounded-2xl border border-border bg-panel p-6 backdrop-blur-xl transition-colors hover:border-accent/40" data-tsd-source="/src/routes/index.tsx:221:17"><span class="absolute -top-1.5 left-6 size-3 rounded-full bg-accent shadow-[0_0_14px_var(--accent)]" data-tsd-source="/src/routes/index.tsx:228:19"></span><div class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-accent" data-tsd-source="/src/routes/index.tsx:235:19">Jan — Apr 2025</div><h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-2xl" data-tsd-source="/src/routes/index.tsx:242:19">Property Consultant</h3><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-muted-foreground" data-tsd-source="/src/routes/index.tsx:243:19">Bold Routes · Dubai Franchise</p><p class="mt-3 text-sm text-pretty text-muted-foreground" data-tsd-source="/src/routes/index.tsx:244:19">Guided clients through property options, organized meetings, kept CRM data sharp and delivered accurate project and pricing information to hit monthly sales targets.</p></div></div><div class="reveal " style="transition-delay:300ms" data-tsd-source="/src/components/Reveal.tsx:38:5"><div class="group relative h-full rounded-2xl border border-border bg-panel p-6 backdrop-blur-xl transition-colors hover:border-primary/40" data-tsd-source="/src/routes/index.tsx:221:17"><span class="absolute -top-1.5 left-6 size-3 rounded-full bg-primary shadow-[0_0_14px_var(--primary)]" data-tsd-source="/src/routes/index.tsx:228:19"></span><div class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-primary" data-tsd-source="/src/routes/index.tsx:235:19">Sep — Nov 2024</div><h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-2xl" data-tsd-source="/src/routes/index.tsx:242:19">Property Advisor</h3><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-muted-foreground" data-tsd-source="/src/routes/index.tsx:243:19">The Address Investment</p><p class="mt-3 text-sm text-pretty text-muted-foreground" data-tsd-source="/src/routes/index.tsx:244:19">Assisted clients with property inquiries, maintained CRM data and provided accurate project and pricing information.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section id="skills" class="mx-auto max-w-6xl scroll-mt-20 px-6 py-16" data-tsd-source="/src/routes/index.tsx:253:7"><div class="reveal " data-tsd-source="/src/components/Reveal.tsx:38:5"><div class="mb-10 flex items-end justify-between" data-tsd-source="/src/routes/index.tsx:255